#: admin/views/settings.php:237
msgid "Records each visitor's consent choice (accepted, rejected, or partial) for GDPR accountability. Required by Art. 7(1) GDPR to demonstrate that consent was given."
msgstr "Bilježi svaki odabir privole posjetitelja (prihvaćeno, odbijeno ili djelomično) za GDPR odgovornost. Potrebno prema čl. 7. st. 1. GDPR-a za dokazivanje da je privola dana."

#: admin/views/settings.php:240
msgid "Consent log retention (months)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:242
msgid "How long consent records are kept before automatic deletion. Choose a documented period appropriate to your accountability obligations. Logs older than this period are purged daily."
