msgid "Under GDPR Art. 8, children below the minimum age cannot give valid consent for data processing. When enabled, the visitor sees an age-confirmation checkbox directly above the Accept/Reject buttons; it gates only the Accept path — Reject stays available and is never blocked, and the checkbox is never pre-ticked."
