#: admin/views/settings.php:473
msgid "<strong>Country</strong> (~10 MB) resolves the visitor&#8217;s country only &#8212; enough for country-based banner targeting and most per-jurisdiction rules. <strong>City</strong> (~60&#8211;110 MB) additionally resolves the region / province / state, which a few rules need: sub-national regimes such as <em>Quebec Law 25</em> apply only inside one region of a country, so without City (or a Cloudflare <code>CF-Region-Code</code> header) the plugin can only see &#8220;Canada&#8221; and cannot route that visitor to the Quebec ruleset. Choose City only if you rely on region-level routing &#8212; it is a much larger download. Changing this and clicking &#8220;Update Database&#8221; replaces the installed database."
msgstr "<strong>Country</strong> (~10 MB) razlučuje samo državu posjetitelja &#8212; dovoljno za ciljanje banera po državi i većinu pravila po jurisdikciji. <strong>City</strong> (~60&#8211;110 MB) dodatno razlučuje regiju / pokrajinu / saveznu državu, što je potrebno za nekoliko pravila: subnacionalni režimi poput <em>Zakona 25 iz Quebeca</em> primjenjuju se samo unutar jedne regije države, pa bez Cityja (ili Cloudflareova zaglavlja <code>CF-Region-Code</code>) dodatak vidi samo &#8220;Kanadu&#8221; i ne može usmjeriti tog posjetitelja na ruleset Quebeca. Odaberite City samo ako se oslanjate na usmjeravanje na razini regije &#8212; riječ je o znatno većem preuzimanju. Promjena ove postavke i klik na &#8220;Ažuriraj bazu podataka&#8221; zamjenjuje instaliranu bazu."

